<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index retracement continue.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian Gold Index retracement continue.</headline>
<text>
<p>--------------Australian Gold Index Index-------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 1315 1345 1370 *RSI-14 34.37 *MA-10 1275.8</p>
<p>1265 - 1345  *Sup 1280 1265 1230 *MA-20 1372.1 *MA-40 1460.2</p>
<p>-------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - July 18--------------</p>
